MATHEMATICS
-----------
- Understanding Numbers in Elementary School Mathematics (2011). Hung-Hsi Wu.
  Published by the American Mathematical Society. ISBN: 978-0821852606.
  (Arithmetic curriculum.)
- Algebra (1993). I.M. Gelfand and Alexander Shen. Published by Birkhäuser.
  ISBN: 978-0817636777.
  (Algebra curriculum: arithmetic foundations, algebraic identities, the
  binomial theorem, roots/powers/inequalities.)
- Introduction to Algebra. Richard Rusczyk. Published by Art of Problem
  Solving (AoPS). ISBN: 978-1934124147.
  (Algebra curriculum: algebraic foundations, linear equations, ratios and
  proportions, graphing lines and inequalities, quadratic equations,
  functions, polynomials and exponential functions, sequences and series.)

PHYSICS
-------
- Mechanics (Course of Theoretical Physics, Vol. 1), 3rd edition (1976).
  L.D. Landau, E.M. Lifshitz. Published by Butterworth-Heinemann.
  ISBN: 978-0750628969.
- Mathematical Methods of Classical Mechanics, 2nd edition (1989).
  V.I. Arnold. Translated by K. Vogtmann and A. Weinstein.
  Published by Springer (Graduate Texts in Mathematics, Vol. 60).
  ISBN: 978-0387968902.
- An Introduction to Mechanics, 2nd edition (2013). Daniel Kleppner,
  Robert J. Kolenkow. Published by Cambridge University Press.
  ISBN: 978-0521198110.

